# Mermaid Architecture Diagrams for Quote Generator Project

## 1. High-Level System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph External["External"]
        User["👤 User"]
    end

    subgraph NginxProxy["Nginx Reverse Proxy :80"]
        Nginx["Nginx\nPort 8000"]
    end

    subgraph Application["Application Layer"]
        direction TB
        Frontend["📱 Frontend\nHTML/CSS/JS\nServed by Nginx"]
        Backend["⚙️ Backend API\nRust + Axum\nPort 8080"]
    end

    subgraph DataLayer["Data Layer"]
        Database[("🗄️ PostgreSQL\nPort 5435\nQuotes Data")]
    end

    subgraph Monitoring["Monitoring & Observability"]
        Prometheus[("📊 Prometheus\nPort 9090\nMetrics Collection")]
        Grafana["📈 Grafana\nPort 3000\nDashboards"]
        InfluxDB[("💾 InfluxDB\nPort 8086\nk6 Test Results")]
    end

    subgraph Testing["Load Testing"]
        K6["🧪 k6\nLoad Testing"]
    end

    User -->|HTTP Request| Nginx
    Nginx -->|Static Assets| Frontend
    Nginx -->|API Calls /api/*| Backend
    Backend -->|SQL Queries| Database
    Backend -->|Exposes /metrics| Prometheus
    Prometheus -->|Data Source| Grafana
    K6 -->|Test Traffic| Nginx
    K6 -->|Write Results| InfluxDB
    InfluxDB -->|Query Results| Grafana
```

