## 2. Request Flow Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant N as Nginx<br/>:80
    participant F as Frontend<br/>Static Files
    participant B as Backend API<br/>:8080
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>:5432

    Note over U,DB: Quote Generation Flow
    
    U->>N: GET / (Homepage)
    N->>F: Serve index.html
    F-->>N: HTML/CSS/JS
    N-->>U: Complete Page

    U->>N: GET /api/quotes/random
    N->>B: Forward Request
    
    B->>B: metrics.counter++
    B->>DB: SELECT * FROM quotes ORDER BY RANDOM() LIMIT 1
    DB-->>B: Quote {id, quote, author}
    B-->>N: JSON Response
    N-->>U: {quote: "...", author: "..."}

    Note over U,DB: Health Check Flow
    
    U->>N: GET /api/health
    N->>B: Forward Request
    B->>DB: SELECT 1 (Health Check)
    DB-->>B: OK
    B-->>N: {status: "healthy"}
    N-->>U: Health Response
```

