## 3. Docker Compose Service Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph DockerNetwork["Docker Network: app-network"]
        
        subgraph DatabaseServices["💾 Database Services"]
            Postgres[("PostgreSQL 16\nContainer: quote-db\nPort 5435:5432\nVolume: postgres_data")]
            Influx[("InfluxDB 1.8\nContainer: quote-influxdb\nPort 8086\nVolume: influxdb_data")]
        end

        subgraph AppServices["⚙️ Application Services"]
            Backend["Rust Backend\nContainer: quote-backend\nPort 8080\nBuild: ./backend")]
            Frontend["Frontend\nContainer: quote-frontend\nBuild: ./frontend")]
        end

        subgraph ProxyServices["🌐 Proxy Services"]
            NginxProxy["Nginx Reverse Proxy\nContainer: quote-nginx\nPort 8000:80")]
        end

        subgraph ObservabilityServices["📊 Observability Services"]
            PrometheusSvc["Prometheus\nContainer: quote-prometheus\nPort 9090\nVolume: prometheus_data")]
            GrafanaSvc["Grafana\nContainer: quote-grafana\nPort 3000\nVolume: grafana_data")]
        end

        subgraph TestingServices["🧪 Testing Services"]
            K6Svc["k6 Load Testing\nContainer: quote-k6\nProfile: loadtest")]
        end
    end

    NginxProxy -->|Depends on| Frontend
    NginxProxy -->|Depends on| Backend
    Backend -->|Depends on| Postgres
    Backend -->|Condition: healthy| Postgres
    GrafanaSvc -->|Depends on| PrometheusSvc
    K6Svc -->|Depends on| NginxProxy
    K6Svc -->|Condition: healthy| Influx
    PrometheusSvc -->|Scrapes| Backend
```

