## 4. CI/CD Pipeline Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Dev["Development"]
        DevLocal[Developer Local]
        FeatureBranch[Feature Branch]
        MainBranch[main Branch]
    end

    subgraph CICD["GitHub Actions CI/CD"]
        direction TB
        
        subgraph BackendCI["🔧 Backend CI"]
            Fmt[rustfmt]
            Clippy[clippy lint]
            Test[cargo test]
            BuildRelease[cargo build --release]
        end

        subgraph FrontendCI["🎨 Frontend CI"]
            NpmInstall[npm ci]
            Lint[npm run lint]
            TestFE[npm test]
            BuildFE[npm run build]
        end

        subgraph DockerCI["🐳 Docker Build"]
            BuildBackend[Build Backend Image]
            BuildFrontend[Build Frontend Image]
            PushGHCR[Push to GHCR]
            TagImages[Tag: sha-*, latest]
        end

        subgraph Deploy["🚀 Deploy (main only)"]
            SSH[SSH to Server]
            Snapshot[Snapshot Current Images]
            Pull[Pull New Images]
            Up[docker compose up]
            Health[Health Check]
            Rollback{Rollback?}
        end
    end

    subgraph Production["Production"]
        Server[Production Server]
    end

    DevLocal -->|git push| FeatureBranch
    FeatureBranch -->|Pull Request| MainBranch
    
    MainBranch --> BackendCI
    MainBranch --> FrontendCI
    
    BackendCI --> DockerCI
    FrontendCI --> DockerCI
    
    DockerCI -->|main branch| Deploy
    
    Deploy -->|Success| Server
    Deploy -->|Failure| Rollback
    Rollback -->|Auto| Server
```

