## 6. Load Testing Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph LoadTest["Load Testing with k6"]
        K6Script["k6 Test Scripts\nsmoke_test.js\nload_test.js\nstress_test.js\nspike_test.js\nsoak_test.js"]
        
        subgraph Scenarios["Test Scenarios"]
            Smoke["🚬 Smoke\n2 VUs, 30s"]
            Load["⚡ Load\n100 VUs, 6min"]
            Stress["🔥 Stress\n1000 VUs, 11min"]
            Spike["📈 Spike\n500 VUs, 3min"]
            Soak["🌊 Soak\n50 VUs, 40min"]
        end

        K6Runner["k6 Container\ngrafana/k6:latest"]
    end

    subgraph Target["Target System"]
        Nginx["Nginx Proxy\nPort 80"]
        Backend["Backend API"]
    end

    subgraph Results["Results Storage"]
        InfluxDB[("InfluxDB\nTime Series Data")]
        Grafana["Grafana Dashboard\n'k6 Load Testing Results'"]
    end

    K6Script --> Scenarios
    Scenarios --> K6Runner
    K6Runner -->|HTTP Requests| Nginx
    Nginx --> Backend
    K6Runner -->|Real-time Metrics| InfluxDB
    InfluxDB -->|Query| Grafana
```

